        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-header">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <div class="google-icon">
                <img src="/assets/images/icons8-google-48.png" alt="Google Review">
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-quote">
              "I appreciated the speed above everything: I requested the dumpster friday evening and it was dropped off saturday afternoon. Price was the most competitive and the whole process is smooth and efficient. Would definitely recommend to family and friends"
            </p>
